otted in sydney  australia where they are shooting thor  love and thunder  now it doesn't really make any sense for  sue storm or any of the fantastic four  to appear  in thor love and thunder so everybody  thought well maybe she's filming a scene  for thor love and thunder and she's a  character in that film  perhaps enchantress but it was then  realized that she could actually be  shooting  a post-credits scene a post-credit scene  for thor love and thunder that could  introduce  sue storm and set up the fantastic four  movie because we know that movie is  going to be coming out after thor love  and thunder  now the reason i'm talking about these  rumors that happened a month ago or so  is because of the rumors that are  happening right now new reports and  rumors from small screen and  geekositymac.com state that emily blunt  is no longer in the runs to play  sue storm however this is not because  marvel did not want her  according to small screen emily blunt  wasn't interested in such an extensive  arrangement  edward lotter of small screen explains  it seems as though she just wasn't  comfortable signing a multiple picture  deal with marvel studios due to the  level of her commitment they wanted from  her  emily blunt and john krasinski have two  children together and our source  informed us that blunt didn't think it  would be a good idea to be moving the  family around in order to star in these  marvel movies  and this could very well be the case the  fantastic four aren't going to be  just small characters they introduce for  one movie or two they're going to be  like  iron man and captain america and thor  they're going to get their own movies  but they're also going to pop up in  other team projects as well  then not to mention the projects where  you're going to bring the fantastic four  together with the avengers  and the x-men this will be an insanely  huge project that won't take place for a  while  many years after the first introduction  of the fantastic four  so it is quite a commitment to play a  character in the mcu  and if you have small children at home i  can see how that could be really hard on  an actress however it doesn't really say  much about her husband john krasinski  john krasinski is apparently still in  the running to play mr fantastic  and we do know that at some point in  time last year he did have a zoom call  with people at marvel so he could very  well  already be in negotiations since kevin  feige said they're currently working on  the feature that means casting has to be  done  pretty soon along with the story and the  script  and as i mentioned we have some rumors  about what might happen  in the movie now like i said it's a  rumor nothing is confirmed here but the  rumors actually sound pretty exciting  now it starts off by saying that the  fantastic four will make their first  appearance in ant-man quantum mania  this is something that fans have been  predicting for a pretty long time  instead of the fantastic four going into  space and getting their powers the  traditional way  they could actually go into the quantum  realm get stuck  somehow and that's how they get their  powers this would very much be like  janet van dyne she got stuck inside of  the quantum realm for many many years  and when she came out she said that she  evolved she developed some type of  powers so this would be a very  interesting way to give them their  powers and kind of do a different story  it goes on to say that this film is  going to address the origin of the team  as we would hope it would reed richards  is a brilliant scientist from pym  technologies who found out from darren  cross about pym particles and decided to  study them  he has his own lab at home and kept his  advancement of his studies a secret  until he discovers the quantum realm  already married to sue storm they both  work together to further study the  quantum realm and discover that it is  possible to access it  through the particles 