rs tower under  construction could it possibly go on to  become  the baxter building or maybe doom's  building but right outside that building  is a sign that says we are so excited to  show you  what comes next and then it says one two  three and then a  question mark so perhaps spider-man  could make an appearance in the  fantastic four movie we could get the  relationship between peter parker and  johnny storm and this could indeed  go on to become the baxter building  which i think everybody would be  really really excited about and the last  thing i'll say about this rumor is it  says that reed richards and sue storm  are already  married which is definitely a different  take than the other movies that we've  seen before and again marvel studios is  going to want to go down a different  route  than we've already seen so be sure to  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest  mcu news that is it for our fantastic  four rumors today  let me know what you think about them in  the comments down below and let me know  who you think would play  a good sioux storm slash the invisible  woman in the marvel cinematic universe  let me know down below also don't forget  to check the details about the giveaway  in the description down below as well  for live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching  woof  you

